{"version":1,"content":"<p>前港姐季軍袁文靜（Jane）近日迎來主持生涯的新挑戰，獲邀擔任「港科大商學院與工學院首次聯合校友活動」的大會主持。</p><p>活動於上海外灘華爾道夫酒店盛大舉行，當晚Jane以一襲優雅的黑白漸變平口晚裝現身，高貴又大方，展現出滿滿的氣質與專業風範。</p><p>首次</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:22:17.657653+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T05:01:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:05.255861+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:05.255861+00:00","content_hash":"cf895d651f00829b4813acd14cf7c45f888ad3fb08b92ecae3933a10d012fd10","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}